# The managed exec tool: fixed `ddistro exec --task <session task> --request-json <canonical JSON>`, which runs
# ddistro_exec's dedicated no-network bwrap sandbox on redacted file snapshots. Never the App Server sandbox (it shares
# the network and the account home). Declared only to a client that opts in with ddistroTools: ["exec"], when the
# access library was trusted at session start and the attestation records ddistro_exec's isolation canary passing for
# the exact helper bytes installed now. The limits mirror ddistro_exec, which checks the request again.
